{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"81d2368f-d3c3-4a49-9c70-3679ac84b339","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have implemented the product events specified in [docs/EVENTS.md](file:///private/tmp/h-CrMFhX/docs/EVENTS.md) on the registration and offers screens using the existing `Analytics` wrapper, and documented the changes in [ANSWER.md](file:///private/tmp/h-CrMFhX/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Changes:\n- **`registration_email_started`** ([registration_screen.dart](file:///private/tmp/h-CrMFhX/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart)): Captures when the user begins typing their email address (without sending any PII).\n- **`registration_phone_started`** ([registration_screen.dart](file:///private/tmp/h-CrMFhX/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart)): Captures when the user begins typing their phone number (without sending any PII).\n- **`loan_amount_changed`** ([registration_screen.dart](file:///private/tmp/h-CrMFhX/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart)): Sends `amount` (int) whenever the loan slider changes.\n- **`terms_accepted`** ([registration_screen.dart](file:///private/tmp/h-CrMFhX/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart)): Sends event when the terms \u0026 conditions checkbox is ticked.\n- **`registration_continue_tapped`** ([registration_screen.dart](file:///private/tmp/h-CrMFhX/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart)): Sends `amount` (int) and `terms` (bool) when tapping the Continue button.\n- **`offers_scrolled`** ([offer_screen.dart](file:///private/tmp/h-CrMFhX/lib/screens/offer_screen.dart)): Tracks `offset` (double) via a `ScrollController` attached to the offers list.\n","duration_seconds":113.231079,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":230248,"output_tokens":5211,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":161370,"total_tokens":235459}}}
